msgstr "VLibras Block (Brazilian Sign Language)"

msgid "plugins.block.vlibras.description"
msgstr "Embeds the VLibras widget (the Brazilian government's Portuguese-to-Libras sign-language translator) so deaf readers can translate the journal content."

